      "id": "m01-retry-then-dead",
      "type": "multi_hop",
      "question": "retry_limit 默认是多少次？超过后任务会进入哪个 Redis 键？",
      "retrieved": [
        "05-retry-policy.md",
        "retry.py",
        "05-retry-policy.md",
        "03-configuration.md",
        "08-faq.md",
